gxp 2

given
  point A
  k1 = circle(A)
    r1: r(k1) = 3

construct
  point B on k1
  point C on k1
  segment BC
    d1: |BC| = 4

find
  d2: dist(A, BC)

where
  A (0.45612230736326387, -0.5626638392795976)
  k1 r 3
  B (3.376982297914268, 0.12186294295641407)
  C (0.10037412075830086, 2.4161686883605986)
  r1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d2 label (0.3, 0.3)
